# Bot2's whole library holds no artifact or creature card, so its controller of the destroyed Mox Pearl reveals all ten cards
# (rulings 2017-02-09), exiles and puts nothing onto the battlefield, and still shuffles: the library is the same ten cards in
# another order. Bot1, who controlled nothing destroyed, keeps its library in its exact order.

